    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112">

                <pb facs="0285" n="1245" xml:id="pg1245"/>

                <head>No. 825.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Whitehouse.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 17,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitehouse</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chargé, Mexico:</hi></p>
                <p>Major Oswald H. Ernst, detailed to visit El Paso, will probably start hence
                    Monday. Express satisfaction at promised Mexican co-operation and request proper
                    facilities for Major Ernst.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
